🧠 Key Conceptual Change
MOOG is no longer a solver

In the classical pipeline:

MOOG = abundance inverter

In this branch:

MOOG = forward model engine

It is used inside a probabilistic loop:

θ → MOOG → synthetic EWs → comparison → likelihood
