2. Likelihood (inference/likelihood.py)

Defines statistical agreement between model and data:

import numpy as np

def log_likelihood(ew_obs, ew_model, ew_err):
    return -0.5 * np.sum(((ew_obs - ew_model) / ew_err) ** 2)

This replaces implicit convergence loops (excitation/ionization balance).

