🧭 Recommended Development Path
Phase 1 — Foundation (current branch)
Wrap MOOG as forward model
Build likelihood function
Test on solar Fe lines only
Phase 2 — Stellar parameters
Joint inference of Teff, log g, vturb
Validate against solar reference
Phase 3 — Full abundances
Expand to C, O, Mg, Si, Ca
Introduce abundance vector inference
Phase 4 — Advanced physics
NLTE correction layer
MARCS / STAGGER atmosphere substitution
multi-spectrum fusion (HARPS + HST)
⚠️ Design Philosophy
Do not discard EW pipeline — it remains the observation layer
Do not replace MOOG initially — wrap it
Do not assume LTE failures dominate error budget yet
Prioritize inference structure over new atmospheric grids
